Hi <%= @household.caregiver.first_name %>,

We have your lists for <%= @enrollment.event.name %>. Before we can send your household's share, we still need this from you:

<% @enrollment.payout_needs.each do |need| -%>
- <%= need %>
<% end -%>

It takes about three minutes. Sign in and you will land on the right page:
<%= caregiver_intake_payout_url %>

<% if @enrollment.event.closes_at -%>
Please do this before lists close on <%= l(@enrollment.event.closes_at.to_date, format: :long) %>. After that it cannot be changed online.

<% end -%>
<%= @household.organization.name %>
